:: Robin's Lemonade

<<location "beach">><<effects>>
<<set _robin to statusCheck("Robin")>>
<<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<set _scandalous to ($robinromance is 1 and $worn.under_upper.type.includesAny("swim", "naked") and $worn.under_lower.type.includesAny("swim", "naked") and $worn.upper.type.includes("naked") and $worn.lower.type.includes("naked") and $worn.under_upper.reveal gte 800 and $worn.under_lower.reveal gte 800)>>

You see Robin <<if $robin.stayup isnot 2>>standing<<else>>nodding off<</if>> behind <<his>> lemonade stand.
<<print $robin.timer.hurt gte 1 or $robinbreakupCooldown? "<<He>> glances away when <<he>> sees you." : _robin.trauma gte 40 ? "<<He>> tenses whenever somebody passes <<him>>. When <<he>> sees you, <<he>> gives a small wave." : _scandalous ? "<<He>> stares at your swimwear with <<his>> mouth open, then slowly raises one hand to wave." : $robin.stayup is 2 ? "<<He>> startles awake when <<he>> sees you." : "<<He>> waves when <<he>> sees you.">>

<<if $daily.robin.passout gte 1 and !$daily.robin.passoutTalk>>
	"Hey," <<he>> says when you reach the stand. "Are you feeling better? You had me worried, you know."
	<<set $daily.robin.passoutTalk to 1>>
<<elseif $robin.timer.hurt gte 1 or $robinbreakupCooldown>>
	<br><br>
	"Hey," <<he>> says when you reach the stand. <<He>> looks down at the counter and says nothing else. No customers come by, so the two of you stand in silence.
<<elseif $robinlemonadeintro isnot 1>><<set $robinlemonadeintro to 1>><<set $daily.robin.freeDrink to 1>>
	<<wearProp "lemonade">>
	<br><br>
	"Hey," <<he>> says when you reach the stand. <<He>> <<= $robin.stayup is 2 ? "gives you a tired smile and covers a yawn" : "smiles brightly">>. "It's nice to see you. I want you to try my lemonade." <<He>> mixes water, lemon juice, and sugar in a glass before handing it to you. "It's free." The lemonade is very sweet.
<<elseif $robin.stayup is 2>>
	"It's you," <<he>> says with a big yawn. "I should be trying to get more customers, but I'm too tired."
<<elseif _robin.crossdressing is 2>>
	<<if _robin.startingSex is "f">>
		<<if _robin.breastsize gte 9>> /* massive, huge, gigantic, enormous */
			Robin's normally <<breastsizedesc _robin.breastsize>> breasts look much less obvious under <<his>> chest binding,
			but with <<his>> natural size being so large, they're still quite hard to hide.
		<<elseif _robin.breastsize gte 6>> /* full, large, ample */
			Robin's normally <<breastsizedesc _robin.breastsize>> breasts look much less obvious under <<his>> chest binding,
			but you can see the swell of <<his>> breasts when you look for it.
		<<elseif _robin.breastsize gte 3>> /* small, pert, modest */
			Robin's normally <<breastsizedesc _robin.breastsize>> breasts are nearly undetectable under <<his>> chest binding.
		<<elseif _robin.breastsize gte 1>> /* budding, tiny */
			Robin's normally <<breastsizedesc _robin.breastsize>> breasts are completely undetectable under <<his>> chest binding.
		<</if>>
		<<He>> looks happy though.
	<<else>>
		<<His>> <<npcClothesText _robin "upper">> and big smile makes <<him>> look like a happy girl.
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<robinStandNotice>>
<<lemonade_stand_options>>

:: Robin's Lemonade Purchase

<<location "beach">><<effects>><<wearProp "lemonade">>
<<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<set _robinDrinkCost to setup.inflation.spendPrice(100, "robin")>>
<<money -100 "robin">>
<<if Weather.bodyTemperature gte 36.5>><<set Weather.bodyTemperature to Math.max(Weather.bodyTemperature - 1.0, 36.5)>><</if>>

"<<print $robin.timer.hurt gte 1 or $robinbreakupCooldown? "I guess." : "Sure!">> Just give me a minute..." Robin says, pouring the lemonade into a glass.
<br><br>

	<<He>> hands you the glass with a <<print $robin.timer.hurt gte 1 or $robinbreakupCooldown ? "blank expression" : "smile">>, and you slide <<printmoney _robinDrinkCost>> across the counter.
<br><br>

<<if $robin.timer.hurt gte 1 or $robinbreakupCooldown>>
	<<set $robinmoney += 1>>
	<<balloonRobinAngryPurchase>>

<<elseif $robinpaid is 1 and $daily.robin.freeDrink isnot 1>>
	<<set $daily.robin.freeDrink to 1>>
	<<if $robinStand?.selfSufficient is 1>>
		"Partners drink free," <<he>> says, sliding the money back across to you with a grin. "House rules. I made them up just now."
	<<else>>
		"I-I can't take this from you..." <<he>> says, pushing the money back across to you. "You're already paying Bailey for me. Besides, I'd just end up giving it back to you."
	<</if>>
	<<money _robinDrinkCost "robinDrinkRefund">>

<<elseif $robinpaid is 1>>
	<<set $robinmoney += 1>>
	"I... do have to take it from you this time," <<he>> says, frowning as <<he>> looks down at the money. "I have to pay for the ingredients. I can't keep giving it away, even if I want to."

<<else>>
	<<set $robinmoney += 1>>
	"Thanks for your purchase!" <<he>> says with a smile, putting the money under the counter.

<</if>>
<br><br>

You drink almost the whole glass without stopping. While you finish the last few mouthfuls, you watch the waves reach the beach and pull back again.
<br><br>

"<<print either(
"...Have you ever watched the sky on a clear night? There's so many stars out there... so many worlds just like ours. ...I wish the orphanage had a telescope.",
"Sometimes I like just watching people on the beach. They seem like they're having so much fun...",
"One of these days, I want to go swimming out in the ocean. Do you think anyone would look at me weird for having a school swimsuit?")>>"
<br><br>

<<if Time.hour gte 17>>
	"I need to start carrying my stuff home," Robin says. "There aren't many customers this late. Could you please help me pack this up?"
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Accept (0:30)|Orphanage]]>><<endevent>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><<pass 30>><</link>><<glove>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Refuse|Beach]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<<lemonade_stand_options>>
<</if>>


:: Robin's Lemonade Help

<<location "beach">><<effects>>
<<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<set _robin to statusCheck("Robin")>>

<<if pcAreArmsBound("any")>>
	<<He>> looks at your bound arms. "Oh. You can't help like that. Here." <<He>> walks behind you and undoes the bindings.<<unbind>>
	<br><br>
<</if>>
<<if Time.hour gte 17>>
	<<if _robin.trauma gte 40>>
		"Hey, do you think you can walk me home?" Robin says, shivering. "I don't think I can handle any more of this."
	<<else>>
		"I'd like help carrying my stuff home," Robin says. "People don't buy much lemonade once it's this late."
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	You walk with Robin back to the orphanage.
	<br><br>

	<<if $pleasure gte $pleasuremax>>
		You're almost back when the movement of walking makes your already-aroused body reach its limit.
		<<orgasm>>
		Robin quickly looks away, but <<his>> face turns red.<<npcincr Robin lust 1>>
		<br><br>
	<</if>>
	<<endevent>>
	<<link [[Next|Orphanage]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif $robin.timer.hurt gte 1 or $robinbreakupCooldown>>
	<<balloonRobinAngryHelp>>
	<<lemonade_stand_options>>
<<else>>
	<<He>> smiles<<if _robin.trauma gte 40>> weakly<</if>>.
	<<if $rng gte 81 and (effectiveTransformationLevel("cow") gte 6) and $livestock.intro isnot undefined>>
		<<if _robin.trauma gte 40>>
			"I think I'm okay right now, but could you please stay with me?" Robin asks while rubbing <<his>> hands together.
		<<else>>
			"I have everything I need. You're welcome to stay though. I would like the company."
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		You keep Robin company while <<he>> runs the stand, and chat with <<him>> while there are no customers.
		<<npcincr Robin love 1>><<glove>><<ltrauma>><<lstress>><<trauma -3>><<stress -6>>
		<br><br>

		<<if _robin.dom gte 60>>
			<<generate2>><<person2>>
			A <<person>> approaches the stand.
			<<if _robin.trauma gte 40>>
				"Hi," Robin says, looking down. "O-one pound for lemonade if that's okay."
			<<else>>
				"Welcome," Robin says. "One pound for fresh lemonade."
			<</if>>
			<br><br>
			"Sure, sweetie," the <<person>> says before turning to you. <<His>> eyes move down your body and back to your face before <<he>> smiles. "I remember you. From the farm. Why don't you come with me? I'll bring you home." <<He>> reaches one hand towards you.
			<br><br>
			You remember what happened to you at the farm. You also remember the open fields and the parts of farm life you enjoyed. Unsure which feeling to follow, you hesitate before slowly lifting your hand towards <<hers>>.
			<br><br>
			<<link [[Next|Robin's Lemonade Cow]]>><</link>>
			<br>

		<<else>>
			<<generate2>><<person2>>
			A <<person>> approaches the stand.
			<<if _robin.trauma gte 40>>
				"Hi," Robin says, looking down. "O-one pound for lemonade if that's okay."
			<<else>>
				"Welcome," Robin says. "One pound for fresh lemonade."
			<</if>>
			<br><br>
			"Sure, sweetie," the <<person>> says before turning to you. <<His>> eyes move down your body and back to your face before <<he>> smiles. "I remember you. From the farm. Why don't you come with me? I'll bring you home." <<He>> reaches one hand towards you.
			<br><br>
			You remember what happened to you at the farm, but you also remember the open fields and the parts of farm life you enjoyed. You hesitate, then slowly lift your hand towards <<hers>>. "E-Excuse me, <<sir>>," Robin interrupts. "Your lemonade."
			<br><br>
			The <<person>> looks surprised, but keeps smiling. "Thanks, sweetheart," <<he>> says, taking the cup Robin holds out. "Watch your friend carefully." <<He>> walks away.
			<br><br>
			The next customers only buy lemonade and leave, but Robin keeps looking down at the counter and takes several slow breaths.
			<br><br>

			<<lemonade_stand_options>>
		<</if>>
	<<elseif $rng gte 61>>
		<<if $robinsignintro isnot 1>>
			<<set $robinsignintro to 1>>
			<<He>> crouches behind the stand, and emerges holding a sign. It has "Robin's Lemonade" written on it, with directions beneath.
			<<if _robin.trauma gte 40>>
				"Hey... can you hold this sign and walk around a bit? Just to help get some more customers."
			<<else>>
				"Could you walk across the beach carrying this? More customers would help a lot."
			<</if>>
			<br><br>
		<<else>>
			"Could you advertise my stand again? It really helped last time."
			<br><br>
		<</if>>
		You take the sign and walk down the beach, holding it where people can read the directions to Robin's stand.
		<br><br>
		<<if 1 + (($beauty / 5000) + (fameTotal() / 2000)) gte 6>>
			Several people recognise you after reading the sign. They point towards Robin's stand and start walking that way, while others notice the group and follow them. By the time you turn back, a large crowd has gathered around the stand.
		<<elseif 1 + (($beauty / 5000) + (fameTotal() / 2000)) gte 4>>
			Several people stop to read the sign, then look at you before following the directions. More people notice them walking towards Robin's stand, and a steady stream of customers begins to gather there.
		<<elseif 1 + (($beauty / 5000) + (fameTotal() / 2000)) gte 2>>
			A few people stop to read the sign. Two of them look at you again, then follow the directions towards Robin's stand. A few more customers follow after them.
		<<else>>
			A few people read the sign, but most continue walking along the beach. You cannot tell whether any of them decide to visit Robin's stand.
		<</if>>
		<<famebusiness 1>><<set $robinmoney += Math.round(5 * (1 + (($beauty / 5000) + (fameTotal() / 2000))))>>
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Keep trying|Robin's Lemonade Sign]]>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<if hasSexStat("promiscuity", 2)>>
			<<link [[Flirt with potential customers|Robin's Lemonade Flirt]]>><<famebusiness 1>><</link>><<promiscuous2>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
		<<robinStandNudeLink "beach">>
	<<elseif $rng gte 41 and Time.hour gte 9 and Time.hour lte 12 and !$weekly.dorenlemonadebuy>>
		<<set _dorenlemonade to 10 + Math.floor(Math.random()*21)>>

		<<set $weekly.dorenlemonadebuy to true>>
		You walk to the other end of the populated part of the beach, and then back to Robin. <<person1>><<Hes>> serving someone you recognise.
		<br><br>
		<<npc "Doren" 2>><<person2>>
		Doren approaches the stall, wearing
		<<if Time.hour gte 9 and Time.hour lt 10>> /*volunteering*/
			a hi-vi vest
		<<elseif Time.hour gte 10 and Time.hour lt 11>> /*playing volleyball*/
			<<if C.npc.Doren.gender isnot "m">>
				a <<= either ("bikini","swimsuit")>>.
			<<else>>
				a <<= either ("board shorts","speedo")>>.
			<</if>>
		<<elseif Time.hour gte 11 and Time.hour lte 12>> /*swimming/surfing*/
			<<if random(1,2) is 2>>
				<<set _dorenocean to "surfing">>
				a wet suit, surfboard tucked under <<his>> arm.
			<<else>>
				<<if C.npc.Doren.gender isnot "m">>
					a <<= either ("bikini","swimsuit")>>.
				<<else>>
					a <<= either ("board shorts","speedo")>>.
				<</if>>
			<</if>>
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		"Hiya, Robin! Can I get <<print _dorenlemonade>> cups of lemonade?" <<He>> turns to a group of people behind <<him>>. "We're thirsty after
			<<if Time.hour gte 9 and Time.hour lt 10>>
				picking up trash on the beach."
			<<elseif Time.hour gte 10 and Time.hour lt 11>>
				playing volleyball."
			<<elseif Time.hour gte 11 and Time.hour lte 12>>
				<<= _dorenocean isnot "surfing" ? "swimming" : "surfing">>."
			<</if>>
		<br><br>
		<<if _robin.trauma gte 40>>
			"<<print _dorenlemonade>> pounds please, if that's ok."
		<<else>>
			"That'll be <<print _dorenlemonade>> pounds please."
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		"Thanks!" Doren pays Robin before walking off.
		<<set $robinmoney += _dorenlemonade>>
		<br><br>
		<<lemonade_stand_options>>
	<<elseif $rng gte 21>>
		<<if _robin.trauma gte 40>>
			"I'm out of water. I don't want to be alone but could you buy some more?" Robin says nervously. "There's some on High Street that's cheap, but there's some nearby and I don't want you to be away very long..."
			<<He>> places £20 in your hand, but keeps holding your hand for a few seconds before letting go. "Please, hurry back."
			<<set _extramoney to true>>
			<<set $robinmoney -= 20>>
		<<else>>
			"I need more water. I go through it so quickly. I don't like asking because the bottles are heavy, but could you buy some more? High Street sells them cheaper than the shops here." <<He>> hands you £2. "That will pay for one large bottle."
			<<set $robinmoney -= 2>>
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		<<if _robin.trauma gte 40>>
			As you leave the beach, you pass a shop selling large bottles of water. The £20 Robin gave you will pay for four bottles here. High Street is cheaper, but going there would leave Robin alone for longer.
		<<else>>
			As you leave the beach, you pass a shop selling large bottles of water. Robin was right about the price: the water here costs much more. High Street is cheaper, but you would have to carry the bottles much farther.
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Go to High Street (0:15)|Robin's Lemonade High]]>><<pass 15>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<if setup.inflation.canAfford(2000, "robin")>>
			<<link [[Buy water with your own money (<<printprice 2000>>)|Robin's Lemonade Buy]]>><<set $phase to 0>><<money -2000 "robin">><</link>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
		<<if _extramoney>>
			<<link [[Buy water with Robin's money|Robin's Lemonade Buy]]>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
		<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 200>>
		<<link [[Steal the water|Robin's Lemonade Steal]]>><<crimeUp 20 "petty">><</link>><<skulduggerydifficulty>><<crime "petty">>
		<br>
		<<if hasSexStat("promiscuity", 2)>>
			<<if _extramoney>>
				<<link [[Flirt for cheaper water|Robin's Lemonade Seduction]]>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>><<promiscuous2>>
			<<else>>
				<<link [[Flirt for cheaper water|Robin's Lemonade Seduction]]>><<set $phase to 0>><</link>><<promiscuous2>>
			<</if>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<if _robin.trauma gte 40>>
			"I think I'm okay right now, but could you please stay with me?" Robin asks while rubbing <<his>> hands together.
		<<else>>
			"I have everything I need. You're welcome to stay though. I would like the company."
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		You keep Robin company while <<he>> runs the stand, and chat with <<him>> while there are no customers.
		<<npcincr Robin love 1>><<glove>><<ltrauma>><<lstress>><<trauma -3>><<stress -6>>
		<br><br>

		<<if dangerEvent() and $daily.robin.beachPolice isnot 1>>
			<<set $daily.robin.beachPolice to 1>>
			<<endevent>><<generatePolice 1>><<generatePolice 2>>A <<fullGroup>>, both dressed in police uniforms, approach the stand.
			<<if _robin.trauma gte 40>>
				Robin keeps <<nnpc_his "Robin">> eyes on the counter as <<nnpc_he "Robin">> starts speaking. "O-one pound fo—"
			<<else>>
				"Welcome," Robin begins. "One pound for fresh—"
			<</if>>
			<br><br>
			"Shush," <<person1>>the <<person>> interrupts. "We're here to see your permit."
			<br><br>
			"P-permit?" Robin asks.
			<br><br>
			"That's right. Don't tell me you don't have one?"
			<br><br>
			"I don't think <<nnpc_he "Robin">> has one," the <<person2>><<person>> says. "That's twenty years in prison, easy." Robin goes pale.
			<br><br>
			"Yeah," the <<person1>><<person>> says. "Or we can fine you <<printprice 10000>>. Up to you."
			<br><br>
			Robin starts counting out the money with shaking hands.
			<br><br>
			<<link [[Comfort Robin|Robin's Lemonade Comfort]]>><</link>>
			<br>
			<<if setup.inflation.canAfford(10000, "robin")>>
				<<link [[Pay for Robin|Robin's Lemonade Pay]]>><<money -10000 "robin">><<set $daily.robin.policePay to 1>><<famegood 3>><</link>>
				<br>
			<</if>>
			<<if hasSexStat("promiscuity", 3)>>
				<<link [[Offer your body|Robin's Lemonade Offer]]>><<famegood 3>><<set $daily.robin.policeBody to 1>><</link>>
				<br>
			<</if>>
			<<if displayDefiantOption(500)>>
				<<link [[Intimidate|Robin's Lemonade Intimidate]]>><<wolfDefiant 500>><<def 1>><</link>><<defianttext 500>>
				<br>
			<</if>>
		<<else>>
			<<robinStandCompanyEvent "beach">>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>

:: Robin's Lemonade Sign

