<<set _robin to statusCheck("Robin")>>

<<if random(1,2) is 1 and Time.hour gte 9 and Time.hour lte 12 and !$weekly.dorenlemonadebuy>>
		<<set _dorenlemonade to 10 + Math.floor(Math.random()*21)>>

		<<set $weekly.dorenlemonadebuy to true>>
		<<npc "Doren" 2>><<person2>>
		You walk to the other end of the populated part of the beach, and then back to Robin. <<person1>><<He>> is serving someone you recognise.
		<br><br>
		Doren approaches the stall, wearing
		<<if Time.hour gte 9 and Time.hour lt 10>> /*volunteering*/
			a hi-vi vest
		<<elseif Time.hour gte 10 and Time.hour lt 11>> /*playing volleyball*/
