				<<else>>
					a <<= either ("board shorts","speedo")>>.
				<</if>>
			<</if>>
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		"Hiya, Robin! Can I get <<print _dorenlemonade>> cups of lemonade?" <<He>> turns to a group of people behind <<him>>. "We're thirsty after
			<<if Time.hour gte 9 and Time.hour lt 10>>
				picking up trash on the beach."
			<<elseif Time.hour gte 10 and Time.hour lt 11>>
				playing volleyball."
			<<elseif Time.hour gte 11 and Time.hour lte 12>>
				<<= _dorenocean isnot "surfing" ? "swimming" : "surfing">>."
			<</if>>
		<br><br>
		<<if _robin.trauma gte 40>>
			"<<print _dorenlemonade>> pounds please, if that's ok."
		<<else>>
