:: Robin's Lemonade Flirt
<<location "beach">><<effects>>
<<set _robin to statusCheck("Robin")>>
<!-- I feel like this can be turned into a function -->
<<set $seductiondifficulty to 4000>>
<<seductioncheck>>
<<seductionskilluptext>>
<<seductionskilluse>>
<<promiscuity2>>
<<speechresolve>>

<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
	You approach a small group and point towards Robin's stand. "Um... my friend is selling lemonade over there," you say. You smile at them, then add, "You could come with me, if you want."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
	You stop near a few people and point towards Robin's stand. "My friend is selling lemonade over there," you say. "Would you like to come with me?"
